Corral is an independent work. The source in this repository was written for
this project: it is not a derivative of, and contains no code from, any prior
internal or third-party codebase. Its approach to orchestrating coding agents
was learned from OpenAI's Symphony, and that influence is conceptual only — no
Symphony code is present here.

Some source comments refer to "the pre-rename implementation". That is this same
codebase before it was named Corral, when it still used the `symphony` name in
paths and type names; those notes record why a decision changed, not a source
the code was taken from.

